Quick Settings tile — shade-collapse wait, 400 ms → 300 ms
==========================================================

Build: this head, debug APK (JS bundled), emulator-5554 Gaten_Lookup_Review.

Method: `cmd statusbar expand-settings`, `cmd statusbar click-tile
com.gaten/com.gaten.app.LookupTileService`, then read the service's own
`elapsedSinceTrigger()` stage lines. The shade is dismissed by the tile itself
(`GLOBAL_ACTION_DISMISS_NOTIFICATION_SHADE`). Eight takes total (five checked for
shade pixels, three with the full chain below); every frozen frame was shade-free.

Engine animation scales all 1.0 (`window`, `transition`, `animator`).

Measured collapse (screenrecord, `cmd statusbar collapse`): the shade is visually gone
~150–200 ms after the dismissal dispatch; window focus returns (~125 ms) before it does,
and the accessibility window list keeps the shade at full-display bounds throughout, so
no earlier signal is safe. 300 ms = that bound plus a safety band.

Baseline (this repo's dev, ShadeCollapseMs = 400)
-------------------------------------------------
  Trigger accepted (+0 ms)
  Starting the ordered capture pipeline (fromShade=true, +0 ms)
  performCapture called (+404 ms)
  takeScreenshot requested (+404 ms)
  Screenshot delivered (+411 ms)
  Overlay window added (+441 ms)
  Frozen frame on screen (+484 ms)
  (a second baseline run: performCapture +408, Overlay window added +449, Frozen +516;
   a third: Overlay window added +487, Frozen +539)

This head (ShadeCollapseMs = 300)
---------------------------------
  take 1
    performCapture called (+303 ms)
    takeScreenshot requested (+303 ms)
    Overlay window added (+338 ms)
    Frozen frame on screen (+375 ms)
  take 2
    performCapture called (+303 ms)
    takeScreenshot requested (+303 ms)
    Overlay window added (+338 ms)
    Frozen frame on screen (+371 ms)
  take 3
    performCapture called (+303 ms)
    takeScreenshot requested (+304 ms)
    Overlay window added (+329 ms)
    Frozen frame on screen (+374 ms)

Summary (tile tap → stage)
---------------------------------
  Stage                 Baseline (400)   This head (300)
  Overlay window added  +441–+493 ms     +329–+338 ms   (~ −130 ms)
  Frozen frame on screen +484–+540 ms    +371–+375 ms   (~ −140 ms)

Shade-pixel check: the five extra takes all froze an app frame with the top band's mean
luminance 151.9–152.6 (a shade frame reads far darker); no shade rows were present.

Caveat: measured on an AOSP API 34 emulator. A device whose collapse is slower than the
safety band would freeze a half-collapsed shade; that is the failure mode to watch for and
the wait must go back up if it appears.
